    "body": "@robliou, thanks again for raising this issue! This seems like the case of outdated documentation that needs to reflect the new changes in the codebase. If you look inside the problems folder in `openqaoa-core`, you will see that each problem class is defined in their individual python files. Therefore, the correct syntax to import `MaximumCut` now, is the following:\r\n`from openqaoa.problems import MaximumCut`\r\n\r\nP.S. We will fix this on the website",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
